# Deep2 Qwen32 85TPS — Batch 5/5, item 42
# Base: apply after 0041.
#
# Binds the persistent device KV mirror with exact committed-prefix semantics.
# Only host KV positions not already committed on device are uploaded.
# Candidate K/V is written into the speculative tail, but becomes "committed"
# in mirror bookkeeping only after the target accepts that prefix.
#
# Apply:
#   git -C F:\~dev apply --3way 0042_bind_committed_prefix_kv_delta.patch

